          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$6I find myself drawn to this library. These old texts... they speak of empires rising and falling on the whims of a few.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0It reminds me of the archives I used to study in. Before everything fell apart...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} -1 0 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$8I look at the choices I made, the loyalty I gave to things that only brought ruin... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$2...and I wonder if a person like me can ever truly... 'live' with the choices I have made in my... past.\""
        },
