        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4I don't need grand empires or legacy. I just... I am so tired of being alone...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "question",
          "args": "fork1 \"Tell me, are you actually going to stay? As a real friend?#(Step forward and smile) I'm not going anywhere. You're stuck with me.#(Nod gently) Through the quiet and the heavy days, I'll stay.\""
        },
