        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1(His hands tremble slightly over the piano keys, a soft, broken relief washing over his expression) ...A real friend. I think... I could learn what that means with you.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "500"
